   "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:28:24Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-10-26T23:28:24Z",
   "body": "Fixed on a fork branch: `fix/3669-minimax-cn-url` (head `da00218e`, on upstream `6afbe3f3`) — MiniMax China's presets point at `api.minimax.cn`, and its replies keep their `<think>` split.\n\n**Root cause.** `internal/provider/presets.go` still has `minimax-cn` at `https://api.minimaxi.com/v1` and `…/anthropic`; MiniMax moved the China host, and Responses is served at the same base. Two more places key on that host by name: `internal/gateway/chat.go`'s `inlineThink` suffix list and `internal/provider/planquota.go`'s host switch.\n\n**Change.** `minimax-cn` → `https://api.minimax.cn/v1` (Chat), `…/anthropic`, plus `Responses: https://api.minimax.cn/v1`, Website and KeysURL moved with it; `minimax.cn` added to the `inlineThink` suffix list; `api.minimax.cn` ADDED to the plan-quota switch (the old host stays — I can't prove it stopped answering). The international `minimax` preset is untouched.\n\n**Verified.** Red: `go test -tags nogui ./internal/provider/ -run 'TestMiniMaxThinkingGoesBackInTags'; -run 'TestPlanQuotaSource|TestPlanQuotas'` → `minimax_think_test.go:102: MiniMax-M2.7 at api.minimax.cn: assistant content \"Hello!\", want \"<think>…\"` and `planquota_test.go:50: got \"\" ok=false sure=false` / `planquota_test.go:362: cards: map[…` (no minimax-cn card)\nGreen: `both green; `./internal/provider/` ok in 42s (with `-skip TestUnreadLoginsWriteErrorsKeepCredentials`, the pre-existing synctest fatal at base)` → `ok github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/provider`\n\nNot verified: a live request against `api.minimax.cn` (no CN plan here) — the host and the `/anthropic` path come from MiniMax's docs and the reporter's config; if the plan-quota endpoint did not move, the old host is still tried.\n\nFull `go test -tags nogui ./...` over round 26's branches: 70 packages ok, 5 red (edit `TestWriteAtomicReadOnlyHardLink`, gateway's five, plugin `TestPluginSOCKSProxy`, provider's synctest fatal in `TestUnreadLoginsWriteErrorsKeepCredentials`, testenv `TestProgram`) — every one of them reproduces identically at base `6afbe3f3` in this environment (umask 0027), so none is from this change.\n\nBranch: https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/3669-minimax-cn-url — no PR opened, this repo takes no external PRs; say the word if you'd rather have the patch inline here.",
